(1,	'Добрый день',	'Вас беспокоит Ернар Турсынбекулы, с отдела технического обеспечения. <br><br>Просим Вас продублировать то есть выслать доступы и учетные записи к тестовым проектам и другие доступы к веб приложениям на электронную почту ernar.baimoldaev@gmail.com <br><br>По завершению проверок вышлю ответ<br><br>с ув<br><br><br>',	1,	'Admin',	1531003105,	1,	'inbox',	0,	0);
INSERT INTO `dle_post` (`id`, `autor`, `date`, `short_story`, `full_story`, `xfields`, `title`, `descr`, `keywords`, `category`, `alt_name`, `comm_num`, `allow_comm`, `allow_main`, `approve`, `fixed`, `allow_br`, `symbol`, `tags`, `metatitle`) VALUES
(35,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2018-02-01 17:21:36',	'The series tells the story of two brothers, Yerlan and Samat.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1517484101_7_blmshe_207h300_vil.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br><br><br>',	'The series tells the story of two brothers, Yerlan and Samat. They investigate complex criminal cases which were handed over to the archive of the Ministry of Internal Affairs for the lack or inadequacy of evidence on the suspects. The main mission of their joint investigation, however, is to find a killer of their father.',	'time|8 episodes x42&#039; minutes||trailer|57441||1episode|60632||slider|2018-02/1519106580_7_blmshe_1200h370_vil.jpg||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Criminal Drama||quality|HD||director|Askar-Mukhit Narymbetov||episodes|8x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'Division  №7',	'The series tells the story of two brothers, Yerlan and Samat. The series tells the story of two brothers, Yerlan and Samat. They investigate complex criminal cases which were handed over to the',	'Samat, series, their, Yerlan, tells, brothers, story, mission, evidence, suspects, killer, father, inadequacy, however, investigation, joint, archive, criminal, complex, investigate',	'2',	'division-7',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(34,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2019-02-25 10:00:22',	'<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-04/1524565144_kozaiym_site_207x300_v02.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br>',	'Raised in a wealthy family Erkebulan decides to make Kozaiym to fell in love with him. As time goes by, he doesn’t notice how all of a sudden he fells in love with her. But Kozaiym likes Sultan, with who she chats on the internet with the nickname “Coz I’m”. After some time, she realizes that Sulatan and Erkebulan are brothers. But that is not all. Mother of Kozaiym and a father of Erkebulan were a couple...',	'time|20 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1H2_JcuXu4z_7HZZvsomc7BonZqyR3gzS/view?usp=sharing||trailer|28161||1episode|29148||year|2016||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Akzhol Abilov, Zhasulan Poshanov, Maksat Ospanov||episodes|60x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'All in Love s1',	'Raised in a wealthy family Erkebulan decides to make Kozaiym to fell in love with him. Raised in a wealthy family Erkebulan decides to make Kozaiym to fell in love with him. As time goes by, he',	'Erkebulan, Kozaiym, Raised, decides, family, wealthy, Sulatan, After, realizes, coupl, nickname, father, Mother, brothers, likes, notice, doesn’t, sudden, fells, chats',	'2',	'all-in-love-season-2',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(33,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2019-02-25 10:05:41',	'The television series tells about the role of the mother in our life and simple human values.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1517483449_mothers-dignity_207x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br>',	'<span style=\\\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\\\">The television series tells about the role of the mother in our life and simple human values. It reveals urgent social issues of today\\\'s society. The main character named Nasip is a lone mother. Over time, as her son grows up he goes to study in the city. However, there he faces different difficulties; he has to survive in the city as he has neither apartment no permanent earnings. At this moment he meets a girl, Ainur, from a wealthy family. After some time, they get married and Azamat decides to take his mother to the city. However, Ainur does not want to share space with her mother-in-law, and a conflict begins between the women.</span>',	'time|4 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1miKOG5WnUd20pcZnB7PFQvbkYI-lFw2K/view?usp=sharing||trailer|42535||1episode|50811||2episode|50812||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Tolegen Beyset||episodes|4x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'The Main Person',	'The television series tells about the role of the mother in our life and simple human values.   The television series tells about the role of the mother in our life and simple human values. It',	'mother, Ainur, television, However, human, values, about, simple, series, tells, family, wealthy, meets, After, earnings, moment, space, begins, between, women',	'2',	'mothers-dignity',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(170,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2023-08-11 12:43:18',	'<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2023-08/1691737032_bilsen.jpg\\\" class=\\\"fr-fic fr-dib\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">',	'<span style=\\\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\\\">The story about a young promising football player, Damir, who suddenly, just before going to a European club, broke his leg. Doctors told that now he cannot play football. Damir blames his ex-girlfriend Dinara for this accident because it was her jealousy that caused the accident. Damir falls into a deep depression as he cannot imagine living his life without football. He tries to get back to full fitness in every possible way, but because of a serious injury all attempts are useless. Then he decides to get a job in a sports college as a football coach. In college, he will have not only friends, but also ill-wishers ... What will happen next with Damir? Will he succeed in creating the best team?</span>',	'time|1 season - 20 eps x42&#039; . 2 season - 20 eps x42&#039;||trailer|28168||1episode|29791||2episode|30115||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|drama||quality|HD||director|Ernar Nurgaliyev||episodes|1 season - 20 eps x42&#039; . 2 season - 20 eps x42&#039;||subtitles|1||subtitles_lang|ru. en||mande|0||mande_lang|kz',	'If You Love... (S01, S02)',	'The story about a young promising football player, Damir, who suddenly, just before going to a European club, broke his leg. Doctors told that now he cannot play football. Damir blames his',	'football, Damir, college, because, cannot, accident, injury, serious, possible, fitness, without, every, attempts, tries, decides, happen, succeed, creating, wishers, friends',	'2',	'if-you-love',	0,	1,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(30,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2017-07-31 15:43:28',	'Students of a prestigious university decide to release a modern and popular magazine in which they will write about all their discoveries.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519108350__207h300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br><br>',	'Students of a prestigious university decide to release a modern and popular magazine in which they will write about all their discoveries. Each episode will be an article that raises important issues for students.',	'time|32 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailer|28279||1episode|50818||2episode|50817||slider|2018-02/1519107651__1200h370.jpg||year|2014||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Sitcom||quality|HD||director|Rashid Suleimenov||episodes|32x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|0',	'The Girls',	'Students of a prestigious university decide to release a modern and popular magazine in which they will write about all their discoveries. Students of a prestigious university decide to release a',	'Students, which, about, their, discoveries, magazine, write, university, popular, decide, prestigious, release, modern, issues, students, important, article, episode, raises',	'2',	'the-girls',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(26,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2018-03-03 12:35:18',	'It happens that most people hide their true intentions and preten<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1517483128_double-dealing_207h300_len.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br>d to be not who they really are.',	'Dosym and Kanagat are co-owners of a large pharmaceutical company. Dosym tooks a part of the business away from Kanagat. In order to avenge for their father and return the business, the half-brothers Mansur and Daulet start to play for high stakes. Daulet pretends to be a successful top manager and is getting hired by his father\\\'s former company. Working here, Daulet learns that someone else is trying to grab the business…',	'time|4 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JhMi3kVEpj5HjxtsvX-phYCOSqAFpN1p/view?usp=sharing||trailer|28185||1episode|60630||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Daniyar Abdirahmanov||episodes|4x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'The Double Dealing',	'It happens that most people hide their true intentions and pretend to be not who they really are. Dosym and Kanagat are co-owners of a large pharmaceutical company. Dosym tooks a part of the business',	'Daulet, business, Kanagat, their, company, Dosym, getting, manager, successful, start, stakes, pretends, former, trying, business…, someone, learns, father\'s, Working, hired',	'2',	'the-double-dealing',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(24,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2018-01-30 10:35:25',	'The friendship of a simple girl and a beginning artist grows into love.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1518684302_broken-hearts_207x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br><br>',	'But the man\\\'s mother is against the relationship of her only son and just a regular girl without kith or kin. She tries to destroy their relationship in every way and even ready for a crime. However, the loving hearts are able to overcome any obstacles, even if they are diseases and death on their way.',	'time|20 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iRqTWRcgp3vFQ0LCr2qRq8Q8jmapvv1e/view?usp=sharing||trailer|45576||1episode|46988||slider|2018-02/1519107203_zhrekter_1200x370.jpg||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Arman Sandybayev||episodes|20x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'Broken Hearts',	'The friendship of a simple girl and a beginning artist grows into love. But the man\'s mother is against the relationship of her only son and just a regular girl without kith or kin. She tries to',	'relationship, their, crime, ready, every, However, hearts, death, diseases, obstacles, overcome, loving, tries, grows, artist, beginning, simple, man\'s, mother, friendship',	'2',	'the-broken-hearts',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(25,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2018-01-30 10:41:27',	'The brand new film Alzhir is about Akmolinsk camp of wives of traitors of motherland.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519108149__207h300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br>',	'The main character of the film, a girl named Sveta comes to Astana from Saint Petersburg in order to fulfill the last wish of her grandmother. She had to find out what happened with the young Kazakh soldier, who despite all the difficulties and dangers helped many women and children, sentenced in the camp \\\"ALZHIR\\\" from 1937 to 1953y. He risked his life to save her mother and grandmother from a lot of troubles and starvation. Sveta does not have much information. All that she has is a diary, where her grandmother carefully describes all of her pain and sufferings that she experienced in the camp. The heartwarming story that delivers past and present times will definitely impress the audience and gives a chance to be thankful for freedom.',	'time|5 episode x 42 minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_5YpwanXA0_nVnl6Zi-M0jUCtt8TzCVA/view?usp=sharing||trailer|29231||1episode|61359||slider|2018-02/1519107009__1200h370.jpg||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Anuar Raibayev||episodes|5x42&#039;||subtitles|0||mande|0',	'ALZHIR',	'The brand new film Alzhir is about Akmolinsk camp of wives of traitors of motherland.  The main character of the film, a girl named Sveta comes to Astana from Saint Petersburg in order to fulfill the',	'grandmother, Sveta, where, carefully, describes, sufferings, diary, information, risked, 1953y, mother, troubles, starvation, experienced, heartwarming, gives, audience, chance, thankful, freedom',	'2',	'the-alzhir',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(8,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2017-11-22 10:32:28',	'<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519108298__zhrek_207h300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br>She is a successful designer and co-owner of the famous clothing factory. But everything has changed when she gets involved in accounting scandals. Her partner sets her up and comes off clear, taking part of the capital.',	'She is a successful designer and co-owner of the famous clothing factory. But everything has changed when she gets involved in accounting scandals. Her partner sets her up and comes off clear, taking part of the capital.<br>Being afraid of criminal proceedings, she has nothing to do but ask for a help the father of her daughter, who is unaware of his parentage. She had to sacrifice her love, but now she is broken, dreams are ruined, there is no way out.<br>Did she take right decision in the past? Does she need His help in so many years?',	'time|40 episodes x 45 minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PDAe2yhowKDiglTZGxk7XtR9WRApujh5/view?usp=sharing||trailer|2028||1episode|2014||slider|2018-02/1519107333__zhrek_1200_370.jpg||year|2015-2016||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Zhenis Tumatayev, Gulbarshyn Abu-Bakir||episodes|40x45&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|0',	'Flaming Heart',	'She is a successful designer and co-owner of the famous clothing factory. But everything has changed when she gets involved in accounting scandals. Her partner sets her up and comes off clear, taking',	'comes, scandals, accounting, clear, taking, successful, capital, involved, partner, famous, owner, changed, clothing, designer, factory, everything, ruined, broken, dreams, there',	'2',	'flaming-heart',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(36,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2019-02-25 10:05:04',	'Drama is about a young girl, who came to the bi<br>city and started to live at home of father’s best friend.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-03/1519969072_the_sinderella_story_207x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br>',	'Drama is about a young girl, who came to the big city and started to live at home of father’s best friend. New family did not welcome her properly and even disliked at start. But her innocence and kindness would change their lives and they might even reconsider their behavior. Appearance of Syrgalym will also disclose past secrets of this family. How can the girl from the village influence on modern city people to respect traditional values that were already forgotten in that family?<br><br>',	'time|80 episodes x 40&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/15r5LmUd3H2jJ2DuD8I8a7nddOSAs3MC0/view?usp=sharing||trailer|28158||1episode|2021||year|2013-2014||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Dmitryi Korobkin, Rashid Suleimenov||episodes|80x40&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|0',	'The Cinderella Story',	'Drama is about a young girl, who came to the bi  city and started to live at home of father’s best friend. Drama is about a young girl, who came to the big city and started to live at home of',	'family, about, their, friend, father’s, young, started, Drama, influence, modern, disclose, secrets, village, values, already, forgotten, Syrgalym, traditional, respect, people',	'2',	'the-cinderella-story',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(5,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2017-07-31 16:05:08',	'<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519108250_-arman_207h300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\">',	'The main characters came from orphanage. Cruel fate treats them with harshness. All they want are usual simple dreams - to get a permanent job, create a family and to find their own place in life.<br>Some of them achieved results in their chosen profession, some headed in wrong direction and others are still looking for themselves. They tried a lot to assure themselves, they met different people, they faced countless difficulties, which they had to overcome with keeping their faith in good.',	'time|64 episodes x 45 minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Sos2THoeaZkFGP1Ki-LfK9PAiwsVqLNI/view?usp=sharing||trailer|2025||1episode|2011||slider|2018-02/1519107044_arman_1200h370.jpg||year|2015||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Aibek Daiyrbekov||cast|Kuanysh Kerimkulov, Serik Sharip, Erbol Kerimkulov||episodes|64x45&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|0',	'The Right To Dream',	'Телехикаяда балалар үйі тәрбиеленушілерінің өмірі мен үлкен өмірге жасаған алғашқы қадамдары туралы баяндалады. Кейіпкерлер қуаныш пен қайғыны, алғашқы махаббат сезімдерін, достық пен сатқындықты',	'алғашқы, балалар, махаббат, қуаныш, сезімдерін, қайғыны, достық, Телехикаяда, кешіреді, бастарынан, Кейіпкерлер, сатқындықты, үлкен, баяндалады, тәрбиеленушілерінің, өмірге, өмірі, қадамдары, жасаған, туралы',	'2',	'ayauly-arman',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(14,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2019-02-25 10:01:19',	'<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519108103_tarzaman_resize_210x297_v01_vil.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br><br>Unknown pages of the history of Kazakhstan.',	'After the February Revolution of 1917, a monarchy fell in Russia. The news of the events in Petrograd of Kazakhstan\\\'s population was perceived with a fancy. The Kazakhs welcomed the overthrow of the autocracy, which is justly considered this fact as a consequence of their centuries-old struggle. The leaders of the national liberation movement believed that with the establishment of democracy, freedom and equality, it was time to create national autonomy. This vision of the revolution was shared by most representatives of the Kazakh intelligentsia.',	'time|12 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BF0N1MC9J9jdcdbSUnfFtlIckhEpSNal/view?usp=sharing||trailer|27443||trailer2|30157||1episode|30751||2episode|30752||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Historical drama||quality|HD||director|Murat Bidosov||episodes|12x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'Tar Zaman',	'Unknown pages of the history of Kazakhstan.  The Lifetime Legacy tells about the activities and lives of leaders, under the leadership of the autonomous government, called Alash-Orda. The TV series',	'secrets, country, reveals, series, called, Alash, conveys, experiences, those, years, intelligentsia, Kazakh, dreams, government, autonomous, Lifetime, Legacy, Kazakhstan, history, pages',	'2',	'lifetime-legacy',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(13,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2019-02-25 10:00:48',	'<br>The television series \\\"Kozy Korpesh - Bayan Sulu\\\" tells about beautiful and tragic love.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519107979_kozybayan_priglasitelnoe_207h300_vil.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br><br><br><br><br><img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-01/1515494992_imgonline-com-ua-resize-2fgayddf86u9oes.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\">',	'<span style=\\\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:rgb(255,255,255);\\\">This legend tells how two childhood friends, Sarybay and Karabay, being teenagers swore to each other to marry their unborn children off to each other. They pledged their promise by handfast. However, life disposed differently. Not waiting for the birth of his son, Sarybay perishes on the hunt. Karabay has a beautiful daughter. Kozy and Bayan, who had never seen each other before, one day unexpectedly meet and fall in love. After a while, Karabay decided to give his beloved daughter to marriage with a local batyr, Kodar. Here, Kodar becomes an irresistible barrier to lovers. Beautiful story of the tragic love between Kozy and Bayan today has become a symbol of lovers.</span>',	'time|6 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DoT9b_BaZkNwfRhn1oMD2isEMODTBHsa/view?usp=sharing||trailer|27442||1episode|30746||2episode|30750||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Historical drama||quality|HD||director|Darkhan Sarkenov||episodes|6x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'Kozy Korpesh And Bayan Sulu',	'The television series Kozy Korpesh - Bayan Sulu tells about beautiful and tragic love.   This legend tells how two childhood friends, Sarybay and Karabay, being teenagers swore to each other to marry',	'Bayan, other, Karabay, daughter, Sarybay, tragic, beautiful, tells, lovers, Kodar, their, beloved, marriage, while, before, never, unexpectedly, After, local, decided',	'2',	'kozy-korpesh-and-bayan-sulu',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(20,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2018-01-30 09:50:00',	'A small multinational village near Almaty is a home for a Korean family, Shin, whose eldest son, Rodion, dreams of emigrating to Korea.<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1517483139_homeland_207x300.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br>',	'The younger one, Kostya, just like his parents took a strong liking to Kazakhstan and sees his future only here and wants to marry Irina Jen. But fate plays by its own rules: Irina needs an urgent operation in Korea ... Rodion refuses to help the family, but the neighbors, Kazakhs, Germans, Chechens, Russians, Uyghurs, collect money for treatment ... Rodion does not find happiness in his historical home land, but the land of Kazakhstan empowers everyone who regard it as their own home…',	'time|20 episodes x 42&#039; minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eudDJgGSBaL2CFXo2qF9cgs8aHaqB9Kx/view?usp=sharing||trailer|42530||1episode|60633||slider|2018-02/1519106960_homeland_1200h370.jpg||year|2017||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Eldar Kaparov||episodes|20x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|1',	'Homeland',	'A small multinational village near Almaty is a home for a Korean family, Shin, whose eldest son, Rodion, dreams of emigrating to Korea.  The younger one, Kostya, just like his parents took a strong',	'Rodion, Korea, Kazakhstan, family, Irina, Chechens, Russians, Uyghurs, Germans, Kazakhs, operation, refuses, neighbors, collect, money, regard, their, home…, everyone, empowers',	'2',	'homeland',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
