(9,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2019-02-25 10:02:06',	'<a class=\\\"highslide\\\" href=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2024-05/1715756141_900.png\\\"><img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2024-05/medium/1715756141_900.png\\\" class=\\\"fr-fic fr-dib\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></a>',	'The story is about the single father who raises his kids on his own. The kids cannot accept their mother\\\'s recent loss and blame their father in this tragedy. But they do not know the entire story. Father wastes all his energy and time to make his kids feel love and comfort. Despite all the challengies and circumstances, he is always strong enough to go on and enjoy every success of his kids. Taking this family as an example, drama shows sensitive social issues and leads everyone to believe in themselves, their kids, and their future.',	'time|12 episodes x 45 minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yP7Zby4ymrP6fWHFb9dhLqXPwuoiqB_D/view?usp=sharing||trailer|2026||1episode|70347||slider|2018-02/1519107127__1200x370.jpg||year|2016||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Drama||quality|HD||director|Askar Uzabaev||episodes|12x45&#039;||subtitles|1||subtitles_lang|ru, eng||mande|0',	'Father',	'The story of single father, who is trying to give his children all, and grow them up on his own. The story of single father, who is trying to give his children all, and grow them up on his own.',	'children, story, father, their, single, trying, family, drama, Taking, example, every, enjoy, shows, success, problems, yourself, certainly, future, believe, leads',	'2',	'father',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(149,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2022-11-21 16:54:37',	'<a class=\\\"highslide\\\" href=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2022-11/1669028023_magzhan_eng.jpg\\\"><img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2022-11/medium/1669028023_magzhan_eng.jpg\\\" class=\\\"fr-fic fr-dib\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></a>',	'<span style=\\\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\\\">The historical drama is about one of the Alash intellectuals Magzhan Zhumabayev who said \\\"I believe in youth!\\\". The exciting drama will convey that his contribution to the upbringing of the generation is essential. The series is based on the life journey, creations and social performance of Maghan Zhumabayev. The action takes place from 1915-1921. The main guideline of the series is to acquaint viewers with Magzhan\\\'s poetry and personality.</span><span style=\\\"font-size:14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\\\"><br></span></span>',	'time|4 episodes *42&#039; minutes||trailer|108102||year|2022||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Historical drama||director|Sarkenov D.||episodes|4 episodes *42&#039; minutes||subtitles|1||subtitles_lang|english, russian||mande|0',	'Magzhan. I Believe in Youth',	'4-серийный исторический телесериал рассказывает о жизни и творчестве Магжана Жумабаева, и его героизме, пожертвовавшим головой за народ.',	'героизме, Жумабаева, пожертвовавшим, головой, народ, Магжана, творчестве, исторический, телесериал, рассказывает, жизни, серийный',	'2',	'magzhan-i-belive-in-youth',	0,	1,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(4,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2017-07-31 15:43:28',	'<img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2018-02/1519108107_-sholpan_207h300_vil.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"fr-dib\\\"><br>Series “Aiman – Sholpan” is a series about family. Showing that “call of blood” is not just an empty sound but what people are ready to go for.',	'Series “Aiman – Sholpan” is a series about family. Showing that “call of blood” is not just an empty sound but what people are ready to go for. Characters of series “Aiman and Sholpan”, sisters who got separated in childhood will have to go through many difficulties to find each other in a big country, absolutely intuitionally. And also to understand that own selfishness will have to cede their family ties and desire to help their family.',	'time|100 episodes x 42 minutes||trailerurl|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QexJ3lXaoMEv-EtgS-6xUUJaMTMc1u5A/view?usp=sharing||trailer|28159||1episode|60636||slider|2018-02/1519107020_-sholpan_1920h1080_vil.jpg||year|2016||country|Kazakhstan||genre|Telenovel||quality|HD||director|Azamatov Rustam||cast|Saltanat Bakayeva, Kamiliya Baitileuova, Ulan Nusipaliyev, Zhalgas Tolganbai, Kalampyr Aisangaliyeva||episodes|100x42&#039;||subtitles|1||mande|0',	'Twin Sisters',	'«Айман-Шолпан» - это, прежде всего, сериал о семье. О том, что «зов крови» - это не пустой звук, а то, ради чего люди способны преодолеть огромные расстояния и пройти множество испытаний.',	'https, множество, пройти, испытаний, Нуржан, korkemfilm, «Айман, продюсер, огромные, постановщики, расстояния, Шолпан», прежде, сериал, преодолеть, семье, способны, пустой, крови», всего',	'2',	'aiman-sholpan',	0,	0,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
