(164,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2023-08-11 10:42:17',	'<a class=\\\"highslide\\\" href=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2024-05/1715672354_1715672342.png\\\"><img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2024-05/medium/1715672354_1715672342.png\\\" class=\\\"fr-fic fr-dib\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></a>',	'Zhibek is a little girl, brave and determined who is always against injustice. She has no difference from other kids in everyday life. When society is in danger, she becomes a real superhero and fights evil forces.',	'time|1 season - 10 eps x 7&#039;. 2 season - 20 eps x 7&#039;.||trailer|120089||year|2021-2022||country|Kazakhstan||genre|animation||quality|HD||director|Haliolla Ramazan||episodes|1 season - 10 eps x 7&#039;. 2 season - 20 eps x 7&#039;.||subtitles|0||mande|0||mande_lang|kazakh',	'Zhibek',	'Zhibek is a little girl, brave and determined who is always against injustice. Although in everyday life she is no different from other children, at a time when society is in danger, she becomes a',	'society, children, other, danger, becomes, forces, fights, superhero, different, everyday, determined, brave, little, always, against, Although, injustice, Zhibek',	'4',	'zhibek',	0,	1,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(181,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2023-08-11 16:22:20',	'<a class=\\\"highslide\\\" href=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2023-08/1691749527_1681720444723.jpg\\\"><img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2023-08/thumbs/1691749527_1681720444723.jpg\\\" class=\\\"fr-fic fr-dib\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></a>',	'<span style=\\\"font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\\\">Aina, the daughter of a wealthy family, follows her future husband Adil to the district hospital in the region. Aina works as a reanimatologist-anesthesiologist in a hospital. There, Aina unexpectedly meets her boyfriend Rawan, whom she once liked. Adil becomes jealous of him. When they get an emergency call to the hospital, they go to help in an ambulance, but the car they are riding in gets into a car accident. The ambulance driver was seriously injured. Investigations and inspections will begin in the hospital. At this time, Aina and Adil\\\'s love will be tested. They go through various obstacles. Can their love survive the unexpected challenges?In addition to medical workers, the status of junior medical workers is shown in the TV series.</span>',	'time|20 episodes *50&#039; minutes||trailer|122973||year|2022||country|Kazakhstan||genre|drama||quality|HD||director|Meiramgul Janatovna||episodes|20 episodes *50&#039; minutes||subtitles|1||subtitles_lang|ru, eng||mande|0||mande_lang|kz',	'Emergency Room',	'Aina, the daughter of a wealthy family, follows her future husband Adil to the district hospital in the region.Aina works as a reanimatologist-anesthesiologist in a hospital.There, Aina unexpectedly',	'hospital, workers, ambulance, medical, Adil\'s, tested, through, begin, inspections, injured, various, seriously, Investigations, survive, status, junior, shown, series, addition, challenges',	'2',	'emergency-room',	0,	1,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
(180,	'anara.sarsembinova',	'2023-08-11 15:58:27',	'<a class=\\\"highslide\\\" href=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2023-10/1697539466_ureyt.png\\\"><img src=\\\"http://distribution.kaztrk.kz/en/uploads/posts/2023-10/medium/1697539466_ureyt.png\\\" class=\\\"fr-fic fr-dib\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></a>',	'<span style=\\\"font-size:14px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\\\">This is the story of three policemen - ordinary guys serving for the good of their country. In search of criminals, in the investigation of complex and intricate cases, they should not miss the main thing - to remain fair, honest and disinterested. And at the same time, do not forget that people who love them are waiting for them at home.</span>',	'time|20 episodes *50&#039; minutes||trailer|120115||1episode|120114||year|2022||country|Kazakhstan||genre|drama||quality|HD||director|Tolegen Beiset||episodes|20 episodes *50&#039; minutes||subtitles|1||subtitles_lang|ru, eng||mande|1||mande_lang|kz',	'Hope and Fear',	'This is the story of three policemen - ordinary guys serving for the good of their country. In search of criminals, in the investigation of complex and intricate cases, they should not miss the main',	'remain, thing, should, cases, honest, disinterested, waiting, people, forget, intricate, complex, serving, ordinary, policemen, three, their, country, investigation, criminals, search',	'2',	'hope-and-fear',	0,	1,	1,	1,	0,	0,	'',	'',	''),
